1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,030
(Amy:)Well, I'm not sure
how this is scored,

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,670
(Sheldon:)but I believe
we may have won.

3
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:10,310
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,810
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

5
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:14,210
(Howard:)Where did he go?

6
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:20,390
(Howard:)We're looking for Sheldon,
not Marmaduke.

7
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,390
(Sheldon:)You whistled?

8
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:25,690
(Leonard:)What is that?

9
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,230
Raiders of the Lost Ark

10
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:29,230
(Sheldon:)with 21 additional seconds.

11
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:33,330
(Sheldon:)If I can't see it,
no one else can see it.

12
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,170
(Leonard:)Sheldon, this is crazy.

13
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:38,870
(Sheldon:)No. Crazy was leaving
the projection booth unattended.

14
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,120
(Sheldon:)Listen to me.

15
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,540
(Leonard:)You are over-tired.
You're not thinking right.

16
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:44,180
(Leonard:)Put the movie back
before we get into trouble.

17
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,250
(Sheldon:)Trouble is my middle name,
Leonard.

18
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:49,050
(Sheldon:)Actually, it's Lee,
but I prefer Trouble.

19
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,520
(Wil Wheaton:)Oh, look who
they let in.

20
00:00:52,520 --> 00:01:00,020
(Sheldon:)Don't worry, Wil Wheaton.
I was just leaving.

